# thrashguard's ignored build and lane outputs.
#
# The R1 lane writes `lcov.info` and `cov-summary.json` into the crate directory,
# and Assay refuses to judge a tree its own command dirtied
# (`NO_MEASUREMENT/DIRTY_TREE`): what it measured must stay the commit it judged.
# The target directory is the shared gate cache in the image, but a local build
# still writes here.
/target/
/lcov.info
/cov-summary.json
# The journal and the lane's own state, as hostobs ignores its own copies.
/.assay/
/.run-gate/
/artifacts/
